WEBVTT

00:04.900 --> 00:06.949
Yeah! Let's go out and play!
It's summer vacation!!
Let's meet again on 9/1!

00:06.950 --> 00:08.900
Is Summer Vacation Real?

00:09.540 --> 00:14.500
Is it true that girls are sensitive when the
insides of their most delicate opening gets dirty?

00:14.930 --> 00:17.080
You're going to see an anime movie?

00:17.081 --> 00:20.000
Glasses Princess the Movie!!
Opens during the summer break!

00:17.200 --> 00:20.200
I thought you've grown
out of those already.

00:21.390 --> 00:23.539
Even though that's what Mom told me,

00:23.540 --> 00:26.899
why must I grow out of the things I like?

00:26.900 --> 00:28.840
Excuse me, my seat's over there.

00:30.250 --> 00:32.189
What!? Isn't she a Gyaru?

00:32.190 --> 00:35.130
Is she with her kid? No, by herself!?

00:35.660 --> 00:38.439
Wow, just look at that makeup.

00:38.440 --> 00:41.100
How can some adult like her
understand Glasses Princess?

00:42.280 --> 00:45.110
Rabi! Transform using these glasses!

00:45.810 --> 00:49.100
O Glasses! The world
of glasses and glasses!

00:50.480 --> 00:53.850
Glasses Princess! Metamorphosis!

00:57.300 --> 01:01.120
Now's the time to show
them our Princess powers!

01:01.860 --> 01:03.990
Let's do this, everyone!

01:08.360 --> 01:10.089
That was amazing.

01:10.090 --> 01:11.440
How about the Gyaru beside me?

01:11.730 --> 01:14.080
I knew it. She fell asleep.

01:16.170 --> 01:18.259
Oh dear, that was amazing.

01:18.260 --> 01:19.550
Too amazing.

01:22.120 --> 01:24.549
Um, please use this.

01:24.550 --> 01:27.250
I'm sorry. Thank you so much.

01:28.160 --> 01:32.739
More and more students are
coming to study at our library.

01:32.740 --> 01:34.150
Summer break?

01:37.740 --> 01:39.199
Thank you.

01:39.200 --> 01:41.860
Oh, you want to borrow these?

01:42.130 --> 01:44.030
Please show me your library card.

01:44.560 --> 01:46.970
I remember she always comes in her uniform.

01:47.200 --> 01:49.950
Casual clothes, huh? It
must really be summer break.

01:50.550 --> 01:56.200
Based on the Nippon Decimal Classification -
https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nippon_Decimal_Classification

01:50.550 --> 01:52.419
Category nine - literature.

01:52.420 --> 01:54.129
Category one - philosophy.

01:54.130 --> 01:56.200
Category two - history.

01:56.540 --> 01:58.530
Always the same books.

01:58.750 --> 02:01.179
I wonder if she has any friends at school?

02:01.180 --> 02:04.180
Somewhat Perverted School Jokes Volume 3
Tell them to your friends tomorrow!

02:05.530 --> 02:08.989
I guess she has friends
she can joke around with.

02:08.990 --> 02:09.990
Thank goodness.

02:11.100 --> 02:12.860
Ojou wakes up.

02:13.260 --> 02:14.729
Morning stretch.

02:14.730 --> 02:16.319
You're amazing, Ojou.

02:16.320 --> 02:17.870
Helping out at club.

02:16.890 --> 02:17.890
I can keep on going!

02:17.990 --> 02:19.620
Reviewing and studying.

02:19.890 --> 02:21.499
I'm done!

02:21.500 --> 02:24.029
Oh my, you're pretty quick today.

02:24.030 --> 02:27.179
Miss, can you prepare the home theater?

02:27.180 --> 02:29.159
Is there a program you would like to watch?

02:29.160 --> 02:29.780
Yes!

02:29.781 --> 02:31.980
Aren't you standing out to much?

02:32.870 --> 02:35.589
Hey! You changed the channel!

02:35.590 --> 02:38.809
Sorry, I wanted to watch this movie.

02:38.810 --> 02:40.629
Eh? Why?

02:40.630 --> 02:44.750
Because I promised Otako
and Ojou that I'd watch it.

02:45.090 --> 02:47.839
The director is someone who
is fast and loose with the budget.

02:47.840 --> 02:49.360
He used up all of his
funds in the beginning...

02:49.361 --> 02:50.660
- Shut up, Bro.
- And then...

02:50.940 --> 02:54.590
Your friendship is the true treasure.

02:58.990 --> 03:01.490
Hey, my dear sister, you awake?

03:01.830 --> 03:04.549
I want you to go shopping for me.

03:04.550 --> 03:05.729
No.

03:05.730 --> 03:10.349
Why not? You used my seagrass hair mask.

03:10.350 --> 03:11.719
Nope.

03:11.720 --> 03:14.869
Jeez, stop being so lazy just
because it's summer break.

03:14.870 --> 03:17.050
Oh no. I'm be going.

03:19.140 --> 03:20.810
Take care now.

03:24.530 --> 03:27.700
I can't leave before
this thing takes effect.

03:29.150 --> 03:32.200
The laxative I took before
going to sleep yesterday.

03:30.200 --> 03:32.806
Letting it out smooth!
For constipation - Froggy A
Works within 6-12 hours, results may vary.

03:32.830 --> 03:36.460
It'll be terrible if it starts
working when I'm out and about.

03:37.890 --> 03:40.669
I'm kinda bored so I'll text Otako.

03:40.670 --> 03:43.120
First week of constipation.

03:43.430 --> 03:48.830
But maybe this has nothing to do with that.
I feel like my belly is sticking out a bit.

03:49.110 --> 03:50.820
Or maybe it's related?

03:51.760 --> 03:53.429
I guess because it's summer?

03:53.430 --> 03:54.880
Oh yeah!

03:56.330 --> 03:58.140
If I wear this...

03:59.240 --> 04:00.840
Middle school uniform!

04:02.140 --> 04:05.730
Oh! The skirt's waist fits perfectly!

04:07.030 --> 04:08.110
It's nothing!

04:11.440 --> 04:14.409
Where's my bowel
movement? it's almost noon...

04:14.410 --> 04:16.739
And Otako hasn't texted back yet.

04:16.740 --> 04:17.829
Oh well.

04:17.830 --> 04:20.180
Let me eat lunch first.

04:20.480 --> 04:24.840
Spicy instant ramen, an egg, seaweed, and the
leftover stir-fried veggies from yesterday.

04:26.070 --> 04:28.109
Put them all together for sour ramen!

04:28.110 --> 04:29.809
Hot and sour noodle soup!

04:29.810 --> 04:31.870
Here I go!

04:32.380 --> 04:33.860
Ribbit ribbit ribbit ribbit!

04:47.470 --> 04:50.300
Oh, Otako responded.

04:50.590 --> 04:53.440
So long! She only
responded to my constipation?

04:50.600 --> 04:54.746
Galko: Conspitated. For a week.
Otako: Huh? What are you talking about?
One week is abnormal.
You need to take care of yourself daily.
Don't just think that a laxative
can make it all go away.

04:54.770 --> 04:57.569
Exercising your abdomen
can help with constipation?

04:57.570 --> 05:01.609
Ouji's abs are very
pronounced. She looks cool.

05:01.610 --> 05:05.049
Otako even texted me
ways of exercising my abs.

05:05.050 --> 05:06.050
How thoughtful.

05:06.890 --> 05:10.349
So the correct way of
working out your abs...

05:10.350 --> 05:18.350
First bend your knees then elevate your head from
the ground until you can see your belly button.

05:19.850 --> 05:20.850
Okay.

05:21.230 --> 05:22.850
Until I can see my belly button...

05:26.630 --> 05:27.700
I can't see!

05:40.810 --> 05:44.490
Oh! They look so nice! Let me show Otako.

05:44.980 --> 05:48.130
Look at my pedicure! Don't the
gradient and the reflection look nice?

05:50.060 --> 05:52.519
I'm taking apart the pieces of all the plastic
models that my brother had left in a pile.

05:52.520 --> 05:55.350
Can you teach me the
proper way to paint them?

05:55.610 --> 05:57.729
Pieces? Taking apart?

05:57.730 --> 05:58.770
What is she talking about?

05:59.520 --> 06:02.339
Time for the right foot!

06:02.340 --> 06:04.650
I hope the two feet can match well!

06:13.440 --> 06:15.600
Excuse me! I have a package for you!

06:19.870 --> 06:22.129
I'm here! I'm home!

06:22.130 --> 06:23.430
Rub, rub!

06:26.520 --> 06:28.479
I'm finally done.

06:28.480 --> 06:31.549
Oh, that package...

06:31.550 --> 06:33.979
It was mine after all.

06:33.980 --> 06:35.470
What did I order?

06:35.550 --> 06:37.096
Become a belly beauty!
All natural oils for your delicate skin.
Perfect-sized Q-tips included.
Lint-Off! Belly button ointment with swabs.

06:37.120 --> 06:39.969
Oh! A belly-button cleaning kit!

06:39.970 --> 06:42.320
The one I filled out the survey for!

06:44.480 --> 06:46.250
Let me try it out right now!

06:51.230 --> 06:53.709
Huh? What's this? Amazing!

06:53.710 --> 06:56.779
It comes out so easily! Interesting!

06:56.780 --> 06:58.080
Let me try some more.

06:59.850 --> 07:01.469
Huh? What are you talking about?

07:01.470 --> 07:03.169
You want to clean the
lint off my belly button?

07:03.170 --> 07:05.619
Sorry, I don't understand
what you're saying.

07:05.620 --> 07:09.059
"Ojou's belly button probably
doesn't have a lot of lint?"

07:09.060 --> 07:10.130
I don't care about that.

07:10.650 --> 07:12.350
Right now, Ojou...

07:16.930 --> 07:18.399
Good work, Senpai.

07:18.400 --> 07:20.390
You're too slow!

07:21.160 --> 07:22.459
Here. Cheers.

07:22.460 --> 07:23.640
Cheers.

07:24.080 --> 07:26.229
You're still working at the delivery place?

07:26.230 --> 07:28.669
What do you mean by that? Of course I am.

07:28.670 --> 07:31.489
I'm having a tough time
working as the school nurse.

07:31.490 --> 07:34.730
It's all a bunch of brats
going through puberty.

07:35.340 --> 07:36.180
I see.

07:36.181 --> 07:40.379
But there's one good part. I get to look at
all the young belly buttons as much as I want.

07:40.380 --> 07:41.620
Aren't you jealous?

07:42.020 --> 07:42.970
No, not really.

07:42.971 --> 07:44.229
Why?

07:44.230 --> 07:46.290
You don't see them all day at your job.

07:47.540 --> 07:49.280
Rub, rub.

07:51.370 --> 07:53.659
I'm sorry for making you wait!

07:53.660 --> 07:56.799
Thank you for the package!

07:56.800 --> 07:58.360
Here's my stamp.

07:59.300 --> 08:00.429
You're right.

08:00.430 --> 08:02.689
Must be nice to see
young girls' belly buttons.

08:02.690 --> 08:04.249
Aren't I right?

08:04.250 --> 08:06.219
I have no interest though.

08:06.220 --> 08:09.509
So I guess you have a
thing for older women?

08:09.510 --> 08:10.780
Where did you get that idea?

08:11.100 --> 08:16.140
Is it true that when two people with
glasses kiss, their glasses get in the way?

08:18.250 --> 08:19.910
What do you want to order?

08:20.550 --> 08:23.229
Oh, there's pepperoni pizza.

08:23.230 --> 08:28.059
Hey Otako, let's share a pepperoni pizza.

08:28.060 --> 08:34.569
Speaking of pepperoni, I heard
that it's a slang term for huge nipples.

08:34.570 --> 08:36.239
Oh, really?

08:36.240 --> 08:39.429
Is it due to the size of the pepperoni?

08:39.430 --> 08:40.809
I guess so.

08:40.810 --> 08:45.249
But your tits are more
like Morteau sausages.

08:45.250 --> 08:47.749
W-What!?

08:47.750 --> 08:49.759
What are Morteau sausages?

08:49.760 --> 08:51.729
Was that joke too complicated?

08:51.730 --> 08:53.080
It's a huge sausage.

08:53.640 --> 08:54.849
Morteau sausage!

08:54.850 --> 08:57.319
They're not that big!

08:57.320 --> 08:59.409
I guess that's the limit of humans.

08:59.410 --> 09:02.020
Putting that aside,

09:02.230 --> 09:06.919
aren't boys way too unaware of
their own nipples compared to girls?

09:06.920 --> 09:09.079
Why this topic all of a sudden?

09:09.080 --> 09:11.069
When I was on the train coming here,

09:11.070 --> 09:15.829
I saw this middle school boy's
nipples straight through his shirt.

09:15.830 --> 09:16.989
Oh, you're right!

09:16.990 --> 09:19.729
You just have to look
away at times like that.

09:19.730 --> 09:22.919
I guess boys aren't embarrassed at all.

09:22.920 --> 09:25.089
Well, there are nipple covers made for men.

09:25.090 --> 09:26.589
Are you serious?

09:26.590 --> 09:29.649
I hear they come in different colors and
sizes, so there are men who are concerned.

09:29.650 --> 09:32.970
Really? But when they're swimming...

09:34.610 --> 09:38.729
So what are we going to
order? Pepperoni pizza?

09:38.730 --> 09:42.560
Please no, I can only think about
nipples now when I think of pepperoni.

09:48.620 --> 09:50.789
Now I'm Otako!

09:50.790 --> 09:53.339
I can't see. Give it back.

09:53.340 --> 09:56.109
Will these get in the way when you kiss?

09:56.110 --> 09:57.259
Especially if both partners
are wearing glasses.

09:57.260 --> 09:58.880
Whatever. Give those back.

09:59.430 --> 10:03.259
I don't know. If their faces are tilted I
guess they won't bump into each other?

10:03.260 --> 10:04.579
Oh, I see.

10:04.580 --> 10:06.929
Let me try. Like this?

10:06.930 --> 10:08.679
What do you think? Will we bump?

10:08.680 --> 10:11.280
I'm telling you, I can't see.

10:11.450 --> 10:12.579
Well?

10:12.580 --> 10:15.700
I think you need to tilt a bit further...

10:20.700 --> 10:24.220
Summertime limited item!
We recommend this!
Tropical mango!
555 Yen (599 Yen including tax)

10:27.190 --> 10:29.500
I'll be taking these dishes away now.

10:30.200 --> 10:32.900
If Ojou was here...

10:33.100 --> 10:35.339
Glasses? Me too!

10:35.340 --> 10:38.199
If Ojou was here...

10:38.200 --> 10:42.520
Kiss? Look! I can tie a cherry
stem knot with my tongue!

10:42.850 --> 10:45.739
Ojou is away with her
family during the summer.

10:45.740 --> 10:47.919
Did you receive a postcard from them, too?

10:47.920 --> 10:49.619
Yes, I brought it with me.

10:49.620 --> 10:52.199
Yeah, that's it. I got one, too.

10:52.200 --> 10:54.280
Spending the summer overseas, huh?

10:52.690 --> 10:55.436
Summer's greetings. I hope you are healthy and doing well. I am with my family now to escape from the
heat. It is a bit cooler here than I imagined and it makes me miss Japan's hot days. Please take care.

10:55.460 --> 10:57.099
That's the north pole, isn't it?

10:57.100 --> 10:59.140
Is there a post office there?

11:10.110 --> 11:11.870
Comet Emperor's Caliburn

11:11.871 --> 11:13.969
The Caliburn movie was interesting.

11:13.970 --> 11:14.850
Yes.

11:14.851 --> 11:18.700
Especially that part when Caliburn and Caletoboof
fought without a word said between them.

11:18.950 --> 11:22.089
I guess it was a bit interesting.

11:22.090 --> 11:24.699
I may not have paid too much attention.

11:24.700 --> 11:26.090
I should have taken the time to...

11:27.830 --> 11:29.480
Yes! Yes!

11:29.920 --> 11:32.209
You were really into it though.

11:32.210 --> 11:35.770
I guess he really likes it deep inside.

11:37.310 --> 11:38.310
Shut up.

11:38.590 --> 11:40.089
What do you want to do now?

11:40.090 --> 11:42.690
I'm hungry! Let's eat first.

11:54.940 --> 11:58.570
I saw them at the movie theater.
Those three guys are always together.

11:59.380 --> 12:01.099
They don't look to be
from the same cliques.

12:01.100 --> 12:04.560
What kind of relationship do they have
to be together during summer vacation?

12:05.200 --> 12:06.060
- Japanese slang term for a playboy.
- Hey, Charao...

12:06.063 --> 12:07.459
Idiot! Don't call me that!

12:07.460 --> 12:09.239
That's my nickname only in class!

12:09.240 --> 12:11.189
You shouldn't say that out loud in public.

12:11.190 --> 12:12.110
Sorry.

12:12.111 --> 12:15.950
W-What!? They have secret
nicknames for each other!?

12:22.300 --> 12:26.199
That's the ace for the other
team, the rumored Sonic Meat.

12:26.200 --> 12:28.629
She doesn't look like
the type to play futsal.

12:28.630 --> 12:31.380
Looks like she's someone tough.

12:31.660 --> 12:33.519
Is that true, Leader?

12:33.520 --> 12:36.239
She must be using
that girth as her strength.

12:36.240 --> 12:40.200
Her play style is probably
rough and barbaric.

12:41.110 --> 12:44.370
We won't lose to someone like that.

12:46.730 --> 12:49.870
Hello there! Let's have a great game today!

12:51.100 --> 12:52.390
Whoa! Sonic Meat!

12:53.280 --> 12:55.759
I accidently called
her out disrespectfully.

12:55.760 --> 12:56.910
Meat!

12:57.200 --> 12:59.829
Jeez, that nickname is a bit much.

12:59.830 --> 13:02.239
I'm just a bit fat.

13:02.240 --> 13:04.840
I guess she's nice, in a normal way.

13:06.320 --> 13:08.650
But I gotta focus now.
Don't think too much.

13:15.340 --> 13:16.650
I'll mark her!

13:18.320 --> 13:19.960
Meat!

13:23.820 --> 13:25.480
Goal!

13:26.910 --> 13:29.239
What!? What's with that meat!?

13:29.240 --> 13:33.069
She's got technique and
power! What do we do now?

13:33.070 --> 13:35.249
Your knees are shaking, Leader.

13:35.250 --> 13:37.809
You see people like that in movies.

13:37.810 --> 13:41.659
Those who are big and fast.

13:41.660 --> 13:43.989
She must make the other
team hang their heads in despair.

13:43.990 --> 13:46.710
Well, hippos are pretty fast in real life.

13:47.480 --> 13:53.600
Is it true that the less material a piece
of underwear has, the more expensive it is?

13:53.790 --> 13:54.819
Yo!

13:54.820 --> 13:56.429
Did you wait long?

13:56.430 --> 13:58.589
No, I just got here.

13:58.590 --> 14:01.219
So where's the recital?

14:01.220 --> 14:04.899
Ojou has directions on her postcard.

14:04.900 --> 14:06.249
For my dear friends in class three,

14:06.250 --> 14:08.999
I'll abbreviate for Otako's sake.

14:09.000 --> 14:13.499
The piano class I attend
will be holding a recital.

14:13.500 --> 14:16.469
I will be playing even
though I am just a beginner.

14:16.470 --> 14:17.909
Please attend if you are able.

14:17.910 --> 14:18.450
So...

14:18.451 --> 14:22.109
I've written how to get
to the recital location.

14:22.110 --> 14:24.759
Please turn left when
you get out of the station.

14:24.760 --> 14:27.089
Turn right at the first intersection.

14:27.090 --> 14:30.550
There's a delicious traditional
Japanese restaurant to your right.

14:31.370 --> 14:35.219
On the opposite side to the left
there's a smokes and liquor store.

14:35.220 --> 14:38.510
The cat who greets you outside
will shake your hand. It's very cute.

14:38.870 --> 14:41.960
Did she really need to
go into such detail? Hey!

14:41.961 --> 14:43.455
Culture Hall

14:43.456 --> 14:45.029
Oh, seems like we're here.

14:45.030 --> 14:46.040
I guess this is it.

14:46.550 --> 14:47.929
Welcome.

14:47.930 --> 14:49.349
Hello.

14:49.350 --> 14:51.789
Okay, please show me your invitation.

14:51.790 --> 14:54.090
Um, will this postcard do?

14:54.340 --> 14:55.340
Let me see.

14:56.200 --> 14:57.515
Please wait a minute.

14:57.516 --> 14:58.639
Receptionist

14:58.640 --> 14:59.640
Yes, that's correct.

15:01.800 --> 15:05.560
Okay. The two of them have arrived.

15:06.090 --> 15:10.189
Thank you for waiting. I
will take you to your seats.

15:10.190 --> 15:12.569
We've somehow become VIPs.

15:12.570 --> 15:15.010
Isn't this just a regular recital?

15:18.610 --> 15:20.600
Everyone's really good.

15:21.590 --> 15:22.910
When is Ojou playing?

15:23.540 --> 15:24.540
She's next.

16:07.780 --> 16:11.160
Ojou's performance was truly amazing.

16:12.320 --> 16:15.081
Later the three of them went to
that traditional Japanese restaurant.

16:15.650 --> 16:17.450
That dress looks wonderful.

16:19.460 --> 16:22.769
Thank you so much for coming!

16:22.770 --> 16:25.959
I was really nervous!

16:25.960 --> 16:28.320
I accidentally wore this out here!

16:28.840 --> 16:30.289
It's the usual Ojou.

16:30.290 --> 16:31.290
Yep.

16:31.640 --> 16:33.519
Have you decided on what to order?

16:33.520 --> 16:34.520
Yes!

16:34.800 --> 16:37.129
I'll have the fried tofu set meal.

16:37.130 --> 16:40.380
I'll have today's
recommendation with a miso soup.

16:40.670 --> 16:42.430
I'll have the usual.

16:42.780 --> 16:44.210
Thank you very much.

16:44.450 --> 16:46.070
They know what you want already?

16:47.670 --> 16:48.799
Curry udon!

16:48.800 --> 16:49.869
Here you go.

16:49.870 --> 16:51.830
The usual curry udon.

16:54.340 --> 16:56.199
She's wearing such a wonderful dress...

16:56.200 --> 16:58.579
The curry udon will get all over her...

16:58.580 --> 16:59.770
I'll start eating first.

17:13.730 --> 17:16.680
Ojou's eating style was truly amazing.

17:18.440 --> 17:20.159
Forget about spilling curry.

17:20.160 --> 17:24.329
This is the first time I've seen
anyone eat curry udon so quietly.

17:24.330 --> 17:26.450
Mmm? What is it?

17:29.950 --> 17:32.269
It's a special occasion.
Let's take a photo together.

17:32.270 --> 17:33.220
Sure.

17:33.220 --> 17:34.010
Okay.

17:34.011 --> 17:37.049
I heard this is the latest model.

17:37.050 --> 17:40.019
Photo booths nowadays are pretty high-tech.

17:40.020 --> 17:42.739
You know how couples
try to take perverted photos?

17:42.740 --> 17:48.959
Apparently the latest models can detect excess skin
color and won't take your photo if you reveal too much.

17:48.960 --> 17:50.109
Oh?

17:50.110 --> 17:54.749
Eh!? I'm revealing quite a
bit today. Will we be okay?

17:54.750 --> 17:57.739
Now that I think about
it, I think that's a lie.

17:57.740 --> 17:59.439
How dare you.

17:59.440 --> 18:01.030
A lie, huh?

18:01.210 --> 18:05.940
So this is the shrine where the
legendary Caliburn anime takes place!

18:06.240 --> 18:07.439
The Holy Land!

18:07.440 --> 18:10.869
This is the fountain that
appeared in episode 24.

18:10.870 --> 18:14.549
Where the siblings had
that famous poignant scene!

18:14.550 --> 18:15.609
Gotta take pics.

18:15.610 --> 18:17.249
Where are the shrine maidens?

18:17.250 --> 18:20.200
I should look into the
guidebook I bought today.

18:32.260 --> 18:34.040
Are you okay?

18:41.410 --> 18:42.590
Gyaru miko!

18:45.530 --> 18:47.989
Here you go. Are you all right?

18:47.990 --> 18:49.799
Thank you...

18:49.800 --> 18:53.239
Sorry to make you see
something embarrassing.

18:53.240 --> 18:54.730
It's fine.

18:55.060 --> 18:58.780
I didn't see any penises or vaginas.

18:59.990 --> 19:01.929
I guess she's a real
gyaru shrine maiden bitch!

19:01.930 --> 19:03.280
But she's so nice...

19:03.281 --> 19:07.020
Interview with a Gyaru at Work

19:09.510 --> 19:10.659
I can't take this anymore.

19:10.660 --> 19:12.240
Yeah, homework sucks.

19:12.660 --> 19:13.660
Look over there!

19:14.520 --> 19:15.819
It's the class president!

19:15.820 --> 19:18.430
You're right. I guess she's
here to do homework, too.

19:18.430 --> 19:20.899
Why don't we ask her to
see if we can copy her's?

19:18.431 --> 19:23.690
I don't understand!

19:20.900 --> 19:24.119
Oh wow! Since she's such a straight
shooter, I think we'll get shot down.

19:24.120 --> 19:25.520
But let's ask anyway.

19:25.720 --> 19:28.749
She's not doing homework...
She's reading some other book.

19:28.750 --> 19:31.140
It looks so thick.
Must be a difficult read.

19:31.530 --> 19:33.469
I guess she's studying something
other than doing homework.

19:33.470 --> 19:37.200
Oh wow. I guess smart people
really study on a different level.

19:37.440 --> 19:38.680
Prez!

19:39.510 --> 19:42.429
We worked hard thanks to you.

19:42.430 --> 19:45.379
We finished all of our homework! Thanks!

19:45.380 --> 19:48.930
I was actually looking at a photo
book about World Heritage sites.

19:49.730 --> 19:51.570
To: The Shrine

19:51.900 --> 19:55.460
Here is Okako looking
for locations of the occult.

19:58.400 --> 20:00.279
Shrine up ahead... Spooky

20:00.280 --> 20:01.960
Spooky...

20:07.460 --> 20:10.900
Give me a big smile! Closer please!

20:21.990 --> 20:24.320
Souvenir! Muscle Skull!

20:34.090 --> 20:36.249
Okachi's really into it today.

20:36.250 --> 20:38.510
Did something good happen?

20:41.850 --> 20:43.699
I finally came.

20:43.700 --> 20:45.970
The adult lingerie store!

20:46.400 --> 20:49.609
If only Senpai was more
chic about asking me.

20:49.610 --> 20:51.500
I brought a condom today.

20:51.840 --> 20:54.069
But I guess since he's interested,

20:54.070 --> 20:57.319
I must have the right underwear!

20:57.320 --> 20:59.199
What's this? So expensive!

20:59.200 --> 21:00.660
Such a thin piece of cloth!

21:01.560 --> 21:04.919
Isn't this just a tiny thread!?

21:04.920 --> 21:08.530
Miss, that piece is very expensive.

21:08.750 --> 21:11.669
You can find more
inexpensive ones at our store.

21:11.670 --> 21:14.349
Sis! Why are you here!?

21:14.350 --> 21:17.539
I'm researching. I work in
the same field, you know.

21:17.540 --> 21:20.639
So middle school students are
interested in these nowadays.

21:20.640 --> 21:24.019
I especially chose a store
where you weren't there, too.

21:24.020 --> 21:25.819
Stop it! Stop writing things down!

21:25.820 --> 21:27.089
What do you think about this?

21:27.090 --> 21:28.560
Absolutely no good.

21:31.040 --> 21:32.489
You free right now?

21:32.490 --> 21:34.089
Let's go somewhere!

21:34.090 --> 21:35.239
I guess for a little while.

21:35.240 --> 21:37.209
I didn't get to sing enough.

21:37.210 --> 21:38.359
Not enough?

21:38.360 --> 21:40.589
Do you still have time, Ojou?

21:40.590 --> 21:41.590
Yep!

21:43.050 --> 21:45.480
What a coincidence. Are
you all here for karaoke?

21:46.330 --> 21:48.405
Let's rent out a big room, then!

21:48.406 --> 21:49.500
Karaoke Bear

21:50.510 --> 21:56.099
Those who can really ramp up
the atmosphere with their singing.

21:56.100 --> 21:58.970
Those can can sing and take
care of the orders for everyone.

21:59.340 --> 22:04.550
Those who choose the
songs that everyone can sing.

22:04.860 --> 22:06.189
Those who sing at their own pace.

22:06.190 --> 22:08.449
Four songs!? But she's so good!

22:08.450 --> 22:09.779
Those who sing at their own pace.

22:09.780 --> 22:11.929
Enka!? But she's so good!

22:11.930 --> 22:13.229
Those who sing at their own pace.

22:13.230 --> 22:16.640
Indian song!? I don't understand
any of it, but she sounds so good!

22:17.140 --> 22:22.150
Is it true that you can create unforgettable
memories during summer vacation?

22:24.350 --> 22:26.559
Hey!

22:26.560 --> 22:29.969
I told you not to play
games during service!

22:29.970 --> 22:32.939
I'll take your phone
away if you keep playing.

22:32.940 --> 22:34.939
No, it's just that I got a text.

22:34.940 --> 22:36.819
Stop finding excuses!

22:36.820 --> 22:38.320
There, there, Sumi.

22:39.620 --> 22:43.040
Let's talk about things between us men.

22:43.520 --> 22:48.020
Smartphone games are good
and all, but be sure to play outside.

22:48.170 --> 22:51.079
You look so weak because
you grew up just playing games.

22:51.080 --> 22:55.229
I play baseball everyday so I'm all buff.

22:55.230 --> 22:56.380
I want to vomit.

22:56.930 --> 22:59.500
Excuse me. I'm going to the restroom.

22:59.700 --> 23:00.700
Fell asleep.

23:03.290 --> 23:07.060
Look! Your legs fell asleep
due to all those games!

23:10.700 --> 23:13.320
I ran right outside without thinking.

23:13.570 --> 23:16.240
Who cares? Everyone's laughing at me.

23:16.630 --> 23:18.520
Jeez, you're so silly.

23:21.840 --> 23:24.250
Who sent that text?

23:24.620 --> 23:27.219
Hey, you dumb idiot! What are you doing?

23:27.220 --> 23:30.549
I'm at the ranch with my
family and milking a cow!

23:30.550 --> 23:32.000
You jelly?

23:32.610 --> 23:34.849
Me, jealous of that!?

23:34.850 --> 23:36.790
You dumb bitch! Idiot!

23:37.250 --> 23:40.300
Oh? What a cute photo.

23:40.450 --> 23:42.480
I guess you made up with each other.

23:43.440 --> 23:44.440
Yo.

23:45.850 --> 23:53.480
Garbage goes into the garbage can.

23:46.090 --> 23:50.119
You're the boy from the
pool. What a coincidence!

23:50.120 --> 23:53.380
Huh? Your knee is bleeding. Let me see.

23:57.010 --> 23:58.010
Does it hurt?

23:58.730 --> 23:59.860
I'm fine.

24:05.330 --> 24:07.299
Oh, I see.

24:07.300 --> 24:09.980
That's what your uncle said?

24:10.310 --> 24:12.849
I get told that a lot, too.

24:12.850 --> 24:14.930
Even now.

24:15.470 --> 24:19.670
Stop dressing up like that! Look at your
grades! You're still young! Things like that.

24:22.640 --> 24:28.130
I think those adults didn't like getting
lectured when they were children, too.

24:28.410 --> 24:31.099
Here you go. The
band-aid's on nice and clean.

24:31.100 --> 24:33.069
Don't go picking at it.

24:33.070 --> 24:34.070
I...

24:35.500 --> 24:38.349
I really hate it when people treat
me like an idiot because I'm a kid.

24:38.350 --> 24:41.929
But I'm sure I'll forget all
about it when I grow up.

24:41.930 --> 24:44.850
When I think that I'll
become that kind of an adult...

24:45.190 --> 24:47.360
I don't want to become an adult at all!

24:54.740 --> 24:59.240
Now you won't forget about
the thoughts you had today.

25:00.830 --> 25:04.790
There goes the evening
bells. I gotta get back.

25:06.790 --> 25:09.440
Later. Be careful on your way back.

25:11.920 --> 25:13.719
Thank you, Big Sis...

25:13.720 --> 25:15.850
I won't ever forget about today...

25:24.440 --> 25:26.430
Never ever!

25:28.570 --> 25:32.169
Hey Sis, did you take a sexy
picture of yourself milking the cow?

25:32.170 --> 25:36.219
Of course! The ultimate sexy picture!

25:36.220 --> 25:37.649
Yeah!

25:37.650 --> 25:39.169
Sexy, yeah!

25:39.170 --> 25:42.270
Is it true that definition of
sexiness has been destroyed?

25:42.380 --> 25:44.750
