26:34.793 --> 26:36.980
- Ima shika deki naku naku nai?
- Isn't the present, like, the time to strike?

26:36.983 --> 26:39.210
- Ma kuro rekishi ni nara nakyaii kedo...
- Maybe, if it doesn't become part of your dark past...

26:39.213 --> 26:41.340
- Higana ichinichi enboku keichin
