26:46.103 --> 26:48.340
- Tsuka maji nanka yabai taranai
- Really? Damn! Somehow it's not enough!

26:48.343 --> 26:50.565
Atashi rani wa jikan ga nainda

26:50.566 --> 26:52.789
We have no time!

26:52.790 --> 26:55.210
- Oshiete ageru garu ni datte
