26:57.543 --> 26:59.760
- Otona ni mo kodomo hairundashi - Because
there are childish people among the adults.

26:59.763 --> 27:02.090
- Shipai janai yo seishun da yo
- It's not a failure, but our youth.

27:02.093 --> 27:04.065
Doki doki shitetai dake nano

27:04.066 --> 27:06.039
We just want to feel excited.

27:06.040 --> 27:08.940
- Motto asobou jitto dekinai
- Let's play more! We can't wait!

27:08.943 --> 27:10.720
Zutto waratetai!

