27:40.720 --> 27:44.029
You're watching a variety show? How rare.

27:44.030 --> 27:45.549
A shrine visit?

27:45.550 --> 27:46.739
Ah, a shrine maiden.

27:46.740 --> 27:48.580
Daze...

27:53.330 --> 27:56.259
He's always in a daze lately.

27:56.260 --> 27:58.860
College students get such long breaks.

27:59.050 --> 28:01.540
And here I am, with school tomorrow.

28:06.050 --> 28:10.030
The photograph that you
requested has been developed.

28:16.030 --> 28:20.200
I wonder what we'll talk
about at school tomorrow?

28:22.340 --> 28:25.180
There's so much to talk about!
